The correct solution is using azure.identity.aio.ClientAssertionCredential
with azure.eventhub.aio.EventHubProducerClient.

4. Make sure the async ClientAssertionCredential is closed correctly after
use:

await credential.close()

Prefer async context managers / finally blocks so the credential is closed
even on failure.

